---
layout: base.njk
---
<main class="article">
  <header class="head wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow center">{{ category | catLabel }}</p>
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
    {% if work %}<p class="work">{{ work }}</p>{% endif %}
    <p class="byline"><strong>박효경</strong><time datetime="{{ page.date | iso }}">{{ page.date | dot }}</time>{% if source %}<span>{{ source }}</span>{% endif %}</p>
  </header>

  {% if image %}
  <figure class="cover wrap">
    <img src="{{ image }}" alt="{{ image_alt or '' }}">
    {% if caption %}<figcaption>{{ caption }}</figcaption>{% endif %}
  </figure>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="prose">
{{ content | safe }}
    </div>

    <div class="info-card">
      <p>{% if seen %}관람 {{ seen | dot }} · {% endif %}작성 {{ page.date | dot }}</p>
      {% if info %}<p>{{ info | nl2br | safe }}</p>{% endif %}
      {% if link %}<p><a href="{{ link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">원문 보기{% if source %} · {{ source }}{% endif %} ↗</a></p>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="author band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow center">Writer</p>
      <p class="name">박효경</p>
      <p>극장 다니는 사람. 연극비평가이자 드라마터그. 극단 성북동비둘기 상주 드라마터그, 공연예술비평 웹진 사이:비평 창간인.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn" href="/#writing">다른 글 보기</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="/#contact">연락하기</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
